  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "1977年夏天，一张25美元罚单飘过纽约街头。",
      "sha256": "c3eb34909d7df7a18571d33c954c025b681f68d96fd32bd726d65e9181479bff",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N1",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "它轻轻落在一辆黄色老式轿车的挡风玻璃上。",
      "sha256": "51431a04311378091f4737ad363aaedcc5e2faa0aef11ee5ad3183bacc07725e",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N1",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "1976年夏天，纽约酷热难耐，夜晚的街头却越来越安静。",
      "sha256": "d0c887911a3b7bd48c48ac7219516c5653f66c9366eccbe87b0ca655440714e5",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N2",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "7月29日深夜，在布朗克斯，一对年轻情侣在车里遇袭。",
      "sha256": "3897275afcad0c2e82742d224fa47c8c92b25f83c89446368e3fa6adcf4cf4fa",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N2",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "凶手用一把.44口径左轮手枪，没留下任何线索。",
      "sha256": "bbf667d8cbd61a19d1b793bc4f45ce7563ad7e272d55951bc63954bb45174381",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N2",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "此后一年，袭击一次次发生在皇后区和布朗克斯。",
      "sha256": "b37da0c4c6dc4dd4ae721251f0cb8ce05b5525fe573db5de816b205702a73bd4",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N2",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "从此纽约人互相提醒：天黑以后，别在车里待着。",
      "sha256": "9ed3a74433c52e1ee3d56905ae0b35d87bf5b17283a719264cdb71028e0ee68a",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N3",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "女人们纷纷剪短头发、换发色，有的人干脆不出门。",
      "sha256": "8d05774d47485314113ee204922489506159ef7f591270021637fb32efdfe000",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N3",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "1977年4月，凶手在案发现场留下了一封信。",
      "sha256": "b55e890ce287926e39393479dc82426640aa42e896ddf366d178690f498a3423",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N3",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "信的署名，是三个字：山姆之子。",
      "sha256": "70a0de342c050c9969014627a0f5aeeb6b908341b094263b49ce1ef5fd516953",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N3",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "五月，他又写信给《每日新闻》专栏作家吉米·布雷斯林。",
      "sha256": "09e9ee4e0fa4bdf5d710229a299c49569d5defb8c1640ee6517262cae5664f3f",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N4",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "信里问：7月29日，也就是他的首案周年，你会送我什么？",
      "sha256": "bfca0a06c3885b63275bf84f268dc8915be5b368a195dfbdfdcbb83288a6386c",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N4",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "那一天，正是他第一次作案的周年。",
      "sha256": "6143115c6750a8d975e95bc71fb9148ffa4ae71fe3838e7373e9612f67451f1b",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N4",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "警方成立了庞大的专案组，通宵追查。",
      "sha256": "0d214d8e080ffb97c26c01482b79d7e5d2dc478f09ef5192817e8735ecaa9048",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N4",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "7月31日深夜，布鲁克林海湾区，又一对年轻人遇袭。",
      "sha256": "dad5c7062b5d529bd30e667dfbcba21e543e8704cfd2def73b99b659f5d759b3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N5",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "邻居西西莉亚·戴维斯出门遛狗，看到了什么？",
      "sha256": "976a094f084c18e5eeb0ed1cbb0823fdd827a6ef8a02646a1c72f06302d847a1",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
